# a text scenario: Settings, the Firewall page, nothing changed (one step per line; see DEVICE-UI-TESTS.md)
name: firewall-page-text
devices: real qemu
restore: none (read-only)
doc: opens the Firewall page of Settings (read only) and checks it is drawn
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Firewall
click-sidebar Firewall
wait app=Settings page=Firewall
shot firewall
expect-not-blank
expect-page Firewall
